Complex sentences"}], "description": "Students learn how to combine ideas without creating run-ons, fragments, or distorted emphasis."}, {"id": "64fab98d-8da7-4d0b-92a7-b34a4bc0fcca", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Sentence rhythm", "children": [{"id": "1ce319a8-f81d-4ac5-b718-3b189268dafc", "type": "concept", "title": "Short declarative sentences"}, {"id": "bb5f3207-d63b-43a9-9410-d737454b202d", "type": "concept", "title": "Emphasis by placement"}, {"id": "4f9332e4-3595-4e87-b436-af6e53494a06", "type": "concept", "title": "Parallel openings"}, {"id": "f68f62f7-dd23-43f9-9ba3-54394319def9", "type": "concept", "title": "Sentence length control"}], "description": "The goal is to vary structure while preserving speed, accuracy, and readability."}]}, {"id": "228f5d0a-e254-4499-9cc9-171e84594ea7", "type": "topic", "title": "Common Grammar Errors and Newsroom Diagnostics", "description": null, "children": [{"id": "98a01c58-b731-4f4d-8411-b0acf581d70e", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Agreement and consistency", "children": [{"id": "a50bd002-2b12-4314-8cd1-fd761ad8cf3c", "type": "concept", "title": "Subject-verb agreement"}, {"id": "aea578b1-faeb-4f1b-9392-33c5e322cdb6", "type": "concept", "title": "Pronoun agreement"}, {"id": "ea55fdc3-c9da-4414-a09d-57ef255c428f", "type": "concept", "title": "Tense shifts"}, {"id": "7acb3353-cc3c-4c6a-b91b-9e1f82dd5e26", "type": "concept", "title": "Number consistency"}], "description": "Students practice checking whether subjects, verbs, pronouns, and tense choices line up across a story."}, {"id": "d9a67ac4-cf11-447b-9884-ca319e08f3cf", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Fragments, run-ons, and comma splices", "children": [{"id": "8579ad14-db08-4819-ae61-d2ab1fc39353", "type": "concept", "title": "Sentence fragments"}, {"id": "b7955b42-dddd-4b76-9e92-e7df8b1e9a1f", "type": "concept", "title": "Fused sentences"}, {"id": "16248394-5f84-4c4d-b96b-5a301a76536f", "type": "concept", "title": "Comma splices"}, {"id": "0b0972b0-8e84-4e19-874a-af06eaa4